<title>USA: Hannaford Bros August sales up 17 percent.</title>
<headline>Hannaford Bros August sales up 17 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SCARBOROUGH, Maine 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hannaford Bros Co said on Friday that sales and other revenues for the four weeks ended August 24 amounted to $239,111,000, an increase of 17.0 percent over the $204,297,000 reported for the same period last year.</p>
<p>It said sales and other revenues for the 34 weeks ended August 24 were $1,902,708,000, up 15.7 percent over the $1,644,943,000 achieved during the first 34 weeks of 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
